{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "bb99c52fa9444e80a91b47fb03f877a5253b56ed634cff8d9efc46176ebef67b", "ja": "Enjoyアダルティ♪", "zh": "享受成人魅力♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "382672b1497f39ff3a03b19b75ce1da0f83f5867ae26e396eb3094a0eceaca91", "ja": "下見のためミリオンパークにきた一同。しか\nし運動不足気味なプロデューサーは、このみ\nと休憩する事に。自分はオトナだからと遠慮\nがちなこのみを、息抜きも大事だと諭し、プ\nロデューサーは再び立ち上がるのだった。", "zh": "为了提前踩点，大家来到了Million Park。然而，有些缺乏运动的制作人决定和木实一起休息。面对一再以自己是大人为由显得有些拘谨的木实，制作人劝她说适当放松也很重要，随后又重新站了起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5dad1983aac666a0824af8a7ce1bdb81c50ee7674568a85a20aa34a34de29190", "ja": "（今日はみんなと、ミリオンパークの下見だ。\n仕事とはいえ、少し楽しみだな）", "zh": "（今天要和大家一起去实地考察百万公园。\n虽然是工作，但还是有点期待啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_02_1002_011ami", "source_sha256": "319c7333ec51d9ce69b9ddde869e70585363dc9fbe6a1822dda033b5218190d5", "ja": "ほらほら、みんな！　次はいよいよ、\nあっちの超難関コースにチャレンジっしょー！", "zh": "快看快看，大家！接下来终于要挑战那边的超高难度赛道了吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_02_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "9889d4de496fc65d1605af8e19d705530cbebe1d90ade42f97c410298c40c08a", "ja": "待ってました♪　普通のコースじゃ、\n張り合いがなかったんだよな～、早く行こうぜ！", "zh": "等你好久啦♪ 普通路线\n根本提不起劲嘛～，快走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_02_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "485a099da05584303803896d71ab6faf694845855e9f8bfe4e3b9004b9f05ae4", "ja": "むむむ、息ひとつ乱れていないとは……！\n亜美ちゃんもすばるんも、さすがだね。", "zh": "唔唔唔，居然连气都没喘一下……！\n亚美和小昴，果然厉害呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_02_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "f2a80722fee9390d0fa7a29e937a88c9e3fae723b46151d8b9c9c40c6bb38edf", "ja": "でも茜ちゃんも、運動神経には自信があるのだ～！\n今日はカワイイだけじゃない茜ちゃん、見せちゃうよ♪", "zh": "不过小茜对自己的运动能力也是很有信心的哦～！\n今天就让你们看看，小茜不只有可爱的一面哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_02_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "9abd43e83d706e0c26cd6df53201e7fc5beaebef912660340cc0d936d7429508", "ja": "ちょ、ちょっと待ってみんな！\n{$P$}が……！", "zh": "等、等一下，大家！  \n{$P$}……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_02_1007_p", "source_sha256": "cbd2bee36f1a7882b4e09a2e2885e3f20c40485483587e963834491a1af57ac6", "ja": "は、ハァッ……ハァッ……。\nぐっ！？　ゲホゲホーッ！", "zh": "哈、哈啊……哈啊……。\n呃！？ 咳咳咳——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_02_1008_011ami", "source_sha256": "e197ec9fc2a4c800d68d917e3178c73aa2995755a16f34c6365786d1caefe822", "ja": "兄ちゃん！？　まさか、運動不足のせいで！？\nそ、そんな……亜美をひとりにしないで、兄ちゃーん！", "zh": "哥哥！？难道是因为缺乏运动！？  \n不、不要……不要把亚美一个人留下，哥——哥！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_02_1009_p", "source_sha256": "470685c46a86c423f7100bdaf7edeb357e92d10c4b4edcb9c8c4d4da16c4e0b2", "ja": "ハァハァ……だ、大丈夫……ゲホッ、ゴホッ！\nみんな、気にしないで、先に行ってくれ……！", "zh": "哈啊哈啊……没、没事……咳咳！\n大家别在意，先走吧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_02_1010_023aka", "source_sha256": "c6b328047cadf9c265ad2e2ce50304456515d3f711a1db10fe6f1cca0cb77e52", "ja": "そんな！　茜ちゃん、そんなコトできないよ！\n{$P$}ちゃんを置いてくなんて！", "zh": "怎么能这样！小茜，这种事我做不到啊！\n怎么能把{$P$}丢在这里不管！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_02_1011_p", "source_sha256": "b58123054314d21aa560bf9c237aaada34320e8608e34123a28f0b7353745a19", "ja": "い、いや、いいから、ちょっと休憩を……。\nウグッ……。", "zh": "不、不，没事，先稍微休息一下吧……  \n呜呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_02_1012_039kon", "source_sha256": "abafd7b1bd9d941a8ee5f9ac60ffcc1aa6c9aff23a60fbd79c7067d570dffea1", "ja": "ほらほら、みんな。私が{$P$}に\nついてるから、気にしないで行ってらっしゃい。", "zh": "好啦好啦，大家。我会陪着{$P$}的，不用担心，你们先去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_02_1013_011ami", "source_sha256": "3426ae3c288d640b43bbea6a6eb7256297403ddd154de44dc82a10f1f60cb7c2", "ja": "うぅっ……兄ちゃんの思い、受け取ったかんね！\n兄ちゃんの分まで遊ぶよ、昴くん、茜ちん！", "zh": "呜呜……大哥的心意，我收下了哦！\n连大哥的那份也一起玩个够吧，昴、茜茜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_02_1014_047sub", "source_sha256": "e8c14fd67228c1781688ed4409c38e23d429777edf941a35987a278bebfeffe0", "ja": "うん！　なあなあ、アスレチックが終わったら何する？\nオレ、キャッチボールしたいかも！", "zh": "嗯！呐呐，玩完攀爬设施后要做什么？\n我可能想玩传接球！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_02_1015_023aka", "source_sha256": "39c355ea802845d8e6fa65efe5a0ca110aba7bd096699a152f125223692fc071", "ja": "茜ちゃんは、スケートがしたいかな。\n案内板によると、スケート場もあるみたいだからね！", "zh": "小茜想去滑冰吧。听指示牌说，这里好像也有滑冰场呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_02_1016_039kon", "source_sha256": "95c3c8072085079fa0d8a5c63952048983e87aae07e1c3fd42ea5c162712ab4c", "ja": "みんな、ケガしないようにね！\n……ふふっ、走っていっちゃったわ。若いわね～。", "zh": "大家小心别受伤哦！\n……呵呵，都跑过去了呢。真年轻呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_02_1017_p", "source_sha256": "477e448e7d5d028caf152375094067ae59dcfaa197fee357d6977c60988819b2", "ja": "ハァ……。す、すみません、このみさん。\n久しぶりに運動をしたせいか、体力が……。", "zh": "哈啊……对、对不起，木实小姐。可能是因为好久没运动了，体力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_02_1018_039kon", "source_sha256": "d884966f7c56225745816ab6f3463b5e09aa4ed2cd808bf4a8fdefcaba6c86e0", "ja": "いいのよ、私もちょっと休みたかったし。\nどこかに座りましょうか。", "zh": "没事的，我也正好想休息一下了。\n找个地方坐坐吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_02_1020_039kon", "source_sha256": "ce25ca255985f3a1f9c032481d8374af3453a2821693e59aa5de810a31346bef", "ja": "ほら、{$P$}。\nお水買ってきたから、飲んで。", "zh": "来，{$P$}。\n我买了水，喝点吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_02_1021_p", "source_sha256": "40de6e7aa53ba473da0bfe4d2089fd14d57251ae722d4fbd80534bbe151bee88", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます……ふぅ。\nなんとか落ち着いてきました。", "zh": "啊，谢谢您……呼。\n总算慢慢平静下来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_02_1022_039kon", "source_sha256": "dd1c059d6d708fe165c7b9f53e3f5c5a569897d043dd900462d1d6038eba7235", "ja": "そう？　よかったわ。\nでも無理しないで、もう少し休んでましょう。", "zh": "是吗？那就好。\n不过别勉强自己，再休息一会儿吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_02_1023_p", "source_sha256": "cf54510e83927d625e9f377363a3315a17735b025e4b781528b2592771759787", "ja": "はい、そうします。\nこのみさんは、みんなと遊んでこなくていいんですか？", "zh": "好的，那我就这么做。\n不过，这样真的没问题吗？不和大家一起去玩吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_02_1024_039kon", "source_sha256": "624c4be1862ebf29642eb57e88c0e1825e565c5ebf5c04940d2eb4610431fce7", "ja": "気にしないで。私も、お仕事で来てるわけだし。\nそれにほら、私は大人！　大人だから！", "zh": "别在意。我也是因为工作才来的嘛。\n而且你看，我可是大人！因为我是大人嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_02_1025_039kon", "source_sha256": "2c51873f83e9f2692d47394ed9891191b724b1300a80816fc7536348d598fa65", "ja": "こうやって、ちょっと離れてみんなを見守ってるのも\n大人の役目だと思うし……フフッ。", "zh": "像这样稍微离大家远一点，在一旁守望他们，我觉得也是大人的职责……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_02_1026_039kon", "source_sha256": "644c5ba6321dcad0e98de9870504e1dbc8aa09ba25e8154a774a60ef70c24971", "ja": "ねえ、今の私と{$P$}って、\n家族みたいに見えるかしら？　なんてね♪", "zh": "呐，你觉得现在的我和{$P$}看起来像家人吗？开玩笑的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_02_1027_p", "source_sha256": "ee57529dbe47b00801d2a33231f993e64a84160b045523f6c97833a5a51c9f97", "ja": "そうですね、確かにそう見えるかもしれません。\n……あの、このみさん。思ったんですけど……。", "zh": "是啊，确实可能会被看成那样。\n……那个，这、这个美小姐。我刚才在想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_02_1028_039kon", "source_sha256": "d5217cd6c82bf7721facbf93fdd98346f847c5155a16c8979c4a3cd148544041", "ja": "えっ？　な、なに？　{$P$}。\nそんな真剣な顔して……。", "zh": "咦？怎、怎么了？{$P$}。\n干吗露出那么认真的表情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_02_1029_p", "source_sha256": "134aada26e4a118deab94c0b1d656ab2bb2df1ebd1b2cb8f78eb62b86e7e236d", "ja": "やっぱり、みんなと合流しませんか？\nこのみさんも、遊んだ方がいいと思うんです。", "zh": "我们还是去和大家汇合吧？\n我觉得木美你也去玩玩比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_02_1030_039kon", "source_sha256": "181a3ba22b08aecd678fc80f9535aad51db174b5911836d53a3de6509cc36e03", "ja": "も……も～っ、{$P$}！\nビックリさせないでちょうだい！　もう！", "zh": "真……真是的，{$P$}！别吓我啦！真是的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_02_1031_039kon", "source_sha256": "c73543f72d404b36af50d5b94d4d6edfc0f038d7b47331321190165ca75bf0f8", "ja": "それに、本当に気を遣わなくていいのよ？\n私も大人だし、そんなにはしゃいだりなんて……。", "zh": "而且，真的不用特意照顾我啦？我也是大人了，不会那么兴奋什么的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_02_1032_p", "source_sha256": "db91bd0692a5526855c177cbd7e7cec2012bd5a69763a6794d387341fc051b08", "ja": "でもこのみさん、ミリオンパークに来てみたかったって\n言ってたじゃないですか。大人も楽しめるからって。", "zh": "可是，这不是因为小此木小姐说过想来百万乐园看看吗？因为这里连大人也能玩得开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_02_1034_p", "source_sha256": "43b016bdd37ee64e7e1d25a08419056752235618e21316413308bea234da9a27", "ja": "大人だからこそ、思いっきりはしゃいだり、\n楽しんだり……息抜きが必要なんだと思います。", "zh": "正因为是大人，才更需要尽情闹一闹、\n玩个痛快……好好放松一下嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_02_1035_039kon", "source_sha256": "ed0a2393577b52bb9b4a93cfdead4a3046ac3f785e5763f089b6e326560b002b", "ja": "フフッ。\nそうね、{$P$}の言うとおりだわ。", "zh": "呵呵。\n没错，就像{$P$}说的那样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
