{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_02_1038_039kon", "source_sha256": "3886207f0d8693b8e2bd3de6f91f4997b66ff591426fc8eb2c4087be68910e23", "ja": "そうね！　みんなを追いかけましょうか。\n今日は思いっきり、楽しんじゃうわよ～♪", "zh": "是啊！我们去追上大家吧。\n今天要尽情享受一番哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
